Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Updated Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report  MS 09  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  CASE  MS 09  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REMOVED_PATIENT_NAME  Date Taken  REMOVED_DATE Source Care Unit  Radiology Outpatient Path Subspecialty Service  Breast 1 Results To  BARBARA LYNN SMITH  M D  HELENANNE D ALESSANDRO  M D  Resident  Gregor Krings  M D   Ph D  Consulting Pathologist s   John H Eichhorn  M D  Signed Out by  John H Eichhorn  M D             Addended Report             Reason for Addendum  1  Additional Immunohistochemistry Results CLINICAL DATA  61 year old female with history of right breast invasive ductal carcinoma  grade2  Status post MRI guided core biopsy of area of indeterminate enhancement seen on MRI in central right breast    invasive carcinoma   FINAL DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   MRI GUIDED CORE BIOPSY  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE REMOVED_DATE of 3  WITH CALCIFICATIONS  SEE NOTE  RADIAL SCAR  FIBROCYSTIC CHANGES  MULTIPLE LEVELS EXAMINED  NOTE  Using immunoperoxidase methods  the ductal carcinoma in situ cells are negative for cytokeratin REMOVED_DATE and cytokeratin 14  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  right   are multiple cores of fibrofatty tissue ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm which are submitted in toto as cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Also received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue admixed with blood coagulum which is submitted in toto as cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Monday August 17   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 49 04PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON   1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICA